{"5060540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project 1815", "steam_appid": 5060540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your battalion as part of a larger army or take command of bots as your team's general with a top down real-time strategy camera. Obey your team general's orders in multiplayer, or vote to mutiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command infantry, artillery, or cavalry and maneuver across  vast, procedurally-generated open battlefields and custom-created maps. Use various formations and artillery types to counter the enemy and gain an advantage. Utilize fully ballistic-modeled projectile physics to skip and bounce your artillery round and canister shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with up to 80 players in online round-based commander battles, using voice and text chat to coordinate your way to victory. Host games as either peer-to-peer lobbies or dedicated servers with an in-game server browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain your troops and friends in multiplayer with an in-game midi editor for custom fife and drum tunes everyone nearby can hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your battalion as part of a larger army or take command of bots as your team's general with a top down real-time strategy camera. Obey your team general's orders in multiplayer, or vote to mutiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/5f9b5fa8c73055b1b15b0cdf4d9113e1.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command infantry, artillery, or cavalry and maneuver across  vast, procedurally-generated open battlefields and custom-created maps. Use various formations and artillery types to counter the enemy and gain an advantage. Utilize fully ballistic-modeled projectile physics to skip and bounce your artillery round and canister shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/a89e2ac34e787dd7f1944b34e51dc1f3.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with up to 80 players in online round-based commander battles, using voice and text chat to coordinate your way to victory. Host games as either peer-to-peer lobbies or dedicated servers with an in-game server browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.poster.avif?t=1787757290\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.webm?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/extras/c8a9b178a0627c82f490d11b0b03d99b.mp4?t=1787757290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain your troops and friends in multiplayer with an in-game midi editor for custom fife and drum tunes everyone nearby can hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Full Scale First/Third Person Napoleonic Tactical Action! Fight alongside thousands of troops in both singleplayer and multiplayer as you captain individual infantry battalions, cavalry squadrons, and artillery batteries, or take command from above as your team's general in round-based team battles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/e869e3864c30ef5cc98b626f3a163a8b5e22c022/header.jpg?t=1787757290", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/7830e6199ad7d6e4e335655cbf243802f4bffd8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787757290", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5060540/7830e6199ad7d6e4e335655cbf243802f4bffd8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787757290", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8400/Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650 / RX 570 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Onboard<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 30 FPS baseline at high unit count, low settings (80 units, 3x scale)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br